{"item_id": "feed:https://www.ssusa.org/content/how-one-postal-match-bridged-u-s-and-australian-smallbore-competition/", "version_id": "fb50bbd75e2a8324f0a41f88e8ed514bca226efebc5ff3a8da6d2f4332215689", "decision": "reject", "reason": "Under the Relevance rule, rejected because the item is about NRA smallbore rifle postal and team competition, not non-firearm competitor gear, and the Exclusions rule bars firearm-focused reviews and competition coverage. No gear claims relevant to Mammoth conditions are present, and the source is an NRA publication with a commercial perspective.", "piece_ids": []}
{"item_id": "feed:https://www.ssusa.org/content/rusty-newton-goes-5-for-5-at-3-119-yards-to-win-king-of-2-miles/", "version_id": "f2abb428b0aa3507c80a25b23bb352bf6fed2cd089b7ec3c3ba752b36815b634", "decision": "reject", "reason": "Under Relevance and Exclusions, rejected because the item is a competition результат report on an ELR match whose gear discussion centers on firearms, chassis, barrels, and ammunition, all excluded. The only non-firearm-adjacent mentions (a Kestrel 5700X and a Swarovski spotting scope) are passing details with no evaluative claims, performance evidence, or independent testing to support them.", "piece_ids": []}
{"item_id": "feed:https://www.ssusa.org/content/jessie-harrison-closes-season-on-top-at-u-s-ipsc-nationals/", "version_id": "b982ffdb38ca9a1df50b01b454476c8da4fd795476cb8c0a3139b6c4d6694472", "decision": "reject", "reason": "Under Relevance and Exclusions, rejected because the item is an IPSC match results report about firearm competition with no non-firearm gear content relevant to Mammoth. The commercial source note and Taurus team affiliation do not change this, since no gear evaluation is offered.", "piece_ids": []}
{"item_id": "feed:https://www.ssusa.org/content/mein-doubles-up-at-2026-nsca-south-central-regional/", "version_id": "c1aa4a1608993168f1a4bdfc97883038ed1247f480858b8cd71dd2b3632cbc56", "decision": "reject", "reason": "Under Relevance and Exclusions, rejected because the item is a sporting clays results report whose only gear content concerns Federal shotshell ammunition, which is excluded. The shooter's comments on paper hulls are an ammunition preference rather than a non-firearm competitor gear evaluation, and the Federal Ammunition sponsorship is noted as a commercial relationship.", "piece_ids": []}
{"item_id": "feed:https://www.ssusa.org/content/new-savage-revel-tactical-puts-an-mdt-stock-on-a-rimfire-lever-gun/", "version_id": "8225f06874e34525fd738860e4b0678ec92b2003359cf6423154f7ff3016b3a0", "decision": "reject", "reason": "Under Exclusions, rejected because the item is a new product announcement for a rimfire firearm, which falls under the firearm review exclusion. Under Freshness and Credibility, the content is a manufacturer-style product post restating specifications with no independent testing, and it does not meet the Relevance categories for non-firearm gear.", "piece_ids": []}
{"item_id": "feed:https://www.ssusa.org/content/kate-estes-wins-2026-iprf-ladies-world-title/", "version_id": "ca4181cad20e0932283242ce1934745ca960ea2c4b4a5ce901f6e655d1f3f990", "decision": "reject", "reason": "Under Relevance and Exclusions, rejected because the item is a competition results report on an IPRF centerfire match, and its only equipment content covers firearm barrels and rifles, which are excluded. The Team Proof Research connection is a commercial relationship, but there is no non-firearm gear evaluation to accept.", "piece_ids": []}
{"item_id": "feed:https://www.ssusa.org/content/suppressor-cleaning-starts-at-the-workbench/", "version_id": "abb3382e73a4dff037ac0ef34798aec37c211a49d7912400df8d05c4e3d20b17", "decision": "reject", "reason": "Under Exclusions, rejected because the article concerns suppressor maintenance, which the policy excludes as suppressor/NFA content, and it also covers gun cleaning and vise tools outside the in-scope gear categories. The products are presented with manufacturer prices and descriptions and no independent testing, and the item has no clear connection to Mammoth conditions.", "piece_ids": []}
{"item_id": "feed:https://www.ssusa.org/content/team-remington-s-connor-thigpen-sweeps-2026-world-skeet-championships/", "version_id": "704d6e7b5a2342dabff212259b59f4c6dadf2d025b888535756ce6633718225d", "decision": "reject", "reason": "Under Relevance, rejected because the item is a shotgun skeet results report with no non-firearm gear evaluation relevant to Mammoth. Its ammunition mentions (Remington STS loads) are excluded, and the Team Remington sponsorship is noted as a commercial relationship.", "piece_ids": []}
